        "text_HiiTMG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Located in the heart of Central London, the project involved the interior design and fit-out of multiple areas within the Infinitum Entertainment office, transforming the space into a confident, contemporary workplace that reflects the brand’s creative energy.</p><p>The design moves away from the previous pastel aesthetic and introduces a sophisticated palette of black, white, and deep red. The result is a workspace that feels modern, cohesive, and distinctly tailored to the needs of a creative entertainment business.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_rKwLCN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>A new private call room has been created<br/></li><li>Bespoke booth seating upholstery with integrated LED lighting<br/></li><li>Acoustic design strategy incorporating wall panelling, acoustic carpeting, and ceiling-suspended baffles</li><li>Refreshed reception area and meeting room</li><li>New breakout space with bespoke joinery and concealed drinks fridge<br/></li><li>Conversion of an existing shower room into a secondary WC</li></ul>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
